  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Powerful, but makes\nthe user flinch if\nhit by the foe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ruby-sapphire",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/5/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Powerful, but makes\nthe user flinch if\nhit by the foe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An attack that is\nexecuted last.\nThe user flinches\nif hit beforehand.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user focuses its mind before\nlaunching this attack. It will fail if\nthe user is hit before it is used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user focuses its mind before\nlaunching this attack. It will fail if\nthe user is hit before it is used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user focuses its mind before\nlaunching this attack. It will fail if\nthe user is hit before it is used.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user sharpens its claws to\nboost its Attack stat and accuracy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user sharpens its claws to\nboost its Attack stat and accuracy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user sharpens its claws to\nboost its Attack stat and accuracy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激勵自己，\n進而提高攻擊和特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user is roused, and its Attack and Sp. Atk\nstats increase.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激勵自己，\n進而提高攻擊和特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user is roused, and its Attack and Sp. Atk\nstats increase.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將頭伸出，\n直直衝向對手進行攻擊。\n有時會讓對手畏縮。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user sticks out its head and attacks by charging\nstraight into the target. This may also make the\ntarget flinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用灌注了巨大力量的重踢\n踢飛對手進行攻擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is attacked by a kick launched with\nmuscle-packed power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
